1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth, 1704 28 (not 18) Aug, shown on household exam, AI.2.41 (1727-70).
2 CONT Olof Larson takes over his father's homestead at Åbyn 10, which he later leaves to sons Matts (our ancestor), Lars, and Anders. Shown on parish register AI:2.41 (1727-50), AI:3.48 (1744-68), and AI:4.71 (1750-1828). Shown at Ljusv
2 CONC attnet, Burträsk, AI:3.48 (1744-90), with wife, kids, and parents. Died 1750-01-13 at Åbyn; age 45 years, 4 months, 1 week, and 6 days old.
2 CONT
2 CONT Shown at Åbyn 10 (from Agneta Olofsson, p. 214):
2 CONT "[Household exam] AI:4 fol 71
2 CONT 1739 Olof Larsson 1704 – 1750 13/1 above
2 CONT gift [17]28 25/3 (18/2 bd) Margareta Mattsdotter Djurman 1710 Umeå Stad – 1788 8/6 Mjövattnet inhyses
2 CONT Karin 29, Åbyn 8
2 CONT Elisabet 30, Åbyn 9
2 CONT Matts 32, below
2 CONT NN – 33, 18/11 tp, 12 öre
2 CONT Mård Lars 35 10/2, Nr 26
2 CONT Brita 36 – 54 /11
2 CONT Margareta 37 – 55 12/12, Umeå Stad, unmarried
2 CONT Kerstin 41 3/12, Åbyn inhyses
2 CONT Anders 44 17/6, below
2 CONT Dmb (Court Judgment book):  Nils Mårtensson in Villvattnet … left some papers in its shed here in the church town.. found the shed broken into…Olof Larsson's in Åby"
2 CONT
