1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johan Hansson, born about 1630Mjödvattnet nr 11 died 1690, owner 1654-1690, Burträsk parish, Västerbotten, Sweden. DNA verified via at least two sons, belonging to haplogroup N-M178>CTS2929>CTS9976>L1022>A13141 Pre
2 CONC dicted.
