2 CONT Anders was "bonde i Lappvattnet 4", like his father Jon Hansson. Shown with wife and his wedded/inherited son at Lappvattnet, Burträsk A1:2.9 (1727-50); died.
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 281270 shows household exam (HFL) for birth, and "KyRä" for death. HFL: Lappvattnet, Burträsk AI:2.9 (1727-70), fader b.1672, AI:4.16 (1750-) åborätt (hereditary lease)
2 CONT
