1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Shown as daughter of Sigrid Flarck,wife of goldsmith Anders[son] Djurman, who then moved to Åbyn 10 when she married Olof Larsson (p. 24, Agneta Olofsson).
2 CONT
2 CONT From Olofsson, "Burträsk" book: Dombok (Court Judgment book) 1749-03-01: Nils Mårtensson in Villvattnet … left some personal papers in his store here in the churchyard.. found the store was broken into… Olof Larsson's wife Margare
2 CONC ta Mattsdotter in Åbyn had a missing tin bottle with her… her son Lars… Lars born on 10 Feb 1735… (p. 214, Agneta Olofsson)
2 CONT
2 CONT At Ljusvattnet, Burtråsk with husband, kids, and his parents, AI:3.48 (1744-68),  Shown as wife, on AI:3.48 (1744-68), then as widow, on AI:4.71 (1750-68), then shown with son's family at Åbyn 6, AI:5.254 (1744-68). Widow dies in 
2 CONC 1778 of infirmities (ålderdomsbräckligheter) at age 78; buried 15 June.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Household exam, Burträsk (AC) AI:3.48 (1744-1790) (AID: v139031.b54.s48, NAD: SE/HLA/1010024), https://www.arkivdigital.se/aid/show/v139031.b54.s48
2 CONT Household exam, Burträsk (AC) AI:4.71 (1750-1828) (AID: v139032.b78.s71, NAD: SE/HLA/1010024), https://www.arkivdigital.se/aid/show/v139032.b78.s71
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, "Burträsk Byar och gårdar 1539-1800" (2007), p. 24 (Mjödvattnet Inhyses), p. 214 (Åbyn 10).
2 CONT Kråken 24 database person 89235, https://kråken.se/ gives sources HFL (birth & death). HFL: Åbyn, Burträsk AI:4.71 (1750-68) #6 and AI:5.254 (1780-88) died.
2 CONT ArkivDigital Death and burial record, Burträsk (AC) EI:1.11 (1775-1788)  (AID: v139084.b14.s11, NAD: SE/HLA/1010024), https://www.arkivdigital.se/aid/show/v139084.b14.s11
