1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sara Lovisa Linder married Johan Fredrik Olofsson and moved to Karolinelund after living in Blattnicksele some time. She grew up in Sandsjön and was Anders Gustaf Linder's oldest daughter (baby no. 2 out of totally
2 CONC  19). Her husband came from Blattnicksele originating from Aha. Sara Lovisa was known for being a good violin musician (at dances and other events). 
