2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Mfff Jon Persson. Född 1695-02-10 i Burträsk. Död 1759-09-26 i Bygdsiljum, Burträsk.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familjenbostrom.se/genealogi/anor/leif/11-300_72.htm
2 CONT ---------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Farm owner, who died at Bygdsiljum 8, AI:4.140 (1750-68). His paternal grandpa (mf mf f) had 3 wives (not all at one time). Child of his 2nd marriage was Jonas Jonsson, father to Lisa.
2 CONT He was stepfather to ancestor Margareta Nilsdotter (1734-1799), after her soldier-father Nils Andersson Ren was killed in Russian war (according to a biography of Nils Andersson Ren per "Mossberg Burträsk," p. 378A.
2 CONT
2 CONT He wed my (ff mf mf m) 5th great grandma Margret, a married widower, who had 5 year old boy Pehr. Margret bore ancestor Jonas, who was my 4th great grandpa, plus 2 other boys, but then Margret died, leaving a 5 year old boy for hi
2 CONC s next wife to bring up. Margret's widower husband Jon Jonsson rewed to a widow Ingeborg Johansdotter, whose husband was killed in the Russian war at Willmansstrand, Finland, and had been left with 4 kids age 2 and up to bring up.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dombok (Court Judgment book) entry from Kråken: Dmb 1742 4/10 Bygdeå: "claimed Jon Persson, from Bygdsiljum, and Daniel Olofsson, from Gammelbyn, and the sister-in-law widow wife Martha Jonsdotter, from Renbergsvatnet, on behalf a
2 CONC nd their brother-in-law and brother Anders Jonsson, from Bygdsiljum, had to be ordered to let it for their inheritance in it pass through death departed d. 19 March Jon Svensson and his wife Lisbeta Tomasdotter's will.. inheritanc
2 CONC e [17]28 7/3.."
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Kråken 14 person 106881, https://kråken.se/ gives sources HFL (birth) and GR178 (death). HFL: Bygdsiljum, Burträsk AI:1.69 (1711-17), AI:2.72 (1727-70) b.1695-02-10, AI:4,4/4,p.140 (1750-) #8; dombok entry in notes.
