1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Biography (from Wikitree):
2 CONT Mårten Larsson was recorded as a homestead owner (hemmansägare) of Bursiljum and Småbacka in the years 1697 to at least 1725. He probably took over the homestead from his father-in-law. The homestead is stated to be 5/16 mantal or
2 CONC  2 tunnland, 4 skälsland [3 acres or 1.2 hectares].  The homestead was previously used by Anders Carlsson [his father-in-law] 1668-78, and his wife Sigrid, 1660-42. He pays testamentary money for an aunt in Svarttjärn with 24 öre,
2 CONC  1698-08-07. Year 1716-08-26 testament by Mårten Larsson's mother in Svarttjärn, 1 daler. At his death, he is listed as dead in Svarttjärn, age 74.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parish household exam records, AI:1.67 and AI:2.66:
2 CONT Bursiljum 8, 5/16 mantal, 2 tunnland, 4 skelsland
2 CONT 1697 Mårten Larsson 1667 - 1741 2/8 tp, Svarttjärn, 74 years 98 7/8 tp moster
2 CONT Sigrid Andersdotter 1674 - 1756 9/10 tp, 1d
2 CONT Kurfurste (Elector) Lars [16]94 4/12 below, No. 9,8  [Kurfurste here not Elector but what Lars was called as soldier]
2 CONT Kerstin- [16]80 27/4 Umeå LFS, 85 years g39 Nils Andersson Bodbyn 5, Umeå LFS
2 CONT Anders [17]00 4/2 Bygdsiljum 5
2 CONT And. Olof ([17]03 29/10) No. 6 <--- [our ancestor]
2 CONT Also :Anna [17]04 24/7, Johan [17]06 3/9 Villvattnet 9, Malin [17]09 13/12 – 84 12/12 and
2 CONT Sara [17]12 18/5 ut32 Bygdsiljum 2, Karin [17]14 25/12 ut37, dmb46, Silver Per [17]18 18/5 No. 8, Frisk Mårten [17]21 No. 14.
2 CONT
2 CONT Krskp (Church account) 1698 7/8: Will by Mårten Larsson's aunt in Svarttjärn, 24 öre.
2 CONT Krskp (Church account) 1716 26/8: Will by Mårten Larsson's mother in Svarttjärn 1d.
2 CONT Dombok (Court Judgment book) 1745: Bequeaths wife Sigrid Andersdotter (!) to her son Lars Mårtensson in Svarttjärn.
2 CONT Dmb (Court Judgment book) 1746 8/10: the man Johan Abrahamsson now serving in Umeå and the woman Karin Mårtensdotter from Siljum were accused of illicit intercourse with each other, of which Karin became pregnant and gave birth to
2 CONC  a boy who is now alive.
2 CONT Dmb (Judgment book) 1705 24/8: farm boy Olof Olofsson born in Lövångers sn and Mårtensbodan ….. as Mårten Larsson's wife Sigrid Andersdotter…
2 CONT
2 CONT DNA notes: Y-700 DNA haplogroup: I-Y96980 (from Dan Anderson, FTDNA kit 1016097).
2 CONT Familytreedna shows a match with haplogroup I-Y96980 (formerly part of I-Y12321) between three of Mårten Larsson's (b. 1667) sons:
2 CONT I1-L1302>...I-M6155>I-FT7755>I-Y12328>I-F64529>I-Y12322>I-Y12321>I-Y96980
2 CONT 1) Daniel Anderson (me), 7th great-grandson of Mårten Larsson,  Y-700 (Big Y) haplogroup I-Y96980, through his son Anders Mårtensson, b. 1700 
2 CONT 2 ) Johan S., paternal descendant of Mårten Larsson, Y-700 (Big Y) haplogroup I-Y96980, through his son Lars Mårtensson b. 1694.
2 CONT 3) Greger Vikström, 6th great-grandson of Mårten Larsson, Y-111 haplogroup I-M5155, through his son Olof Mårtensson, b. 1703 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Larsson-2581
