2 CONT Dombok (Court Judgment book) 1745: Bequeaths wife Sigrid Andersdotter (!) to her son Lars Mårtensson in Svarttjärn.
2 CONT
2 CONT From Kråken: It is uncertain whether Segrid's name is Andersdotter or Östensdotter. Svarttjärn, Burträsk AI:3.71 (1744-90) indicates Aunt Elsa b.1678. The Burträsk dödbok mentions: 1765-05-24 maid (piga) Elsa Östensdotter death of
2 CONC  old age (ålderdom) at 80 years--this should be the same Elsa as above despite age difference of 5 years. On the other hand, the Dombok (Court Judgment Book) 1705 24/8 mentions Sigrid Andersdotter: "farm boy (drängen) Olof Olofsso
2 CONC n born in Lövångers sn and Mårtensbodan ….. as Mårten Larsson's wife Sigrid Andersdotter…." Wikitree mentions "Isak Grape's book on Burträsk p.27 gives her surname as Östensdotter, which is wrong."
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
