1 NAME Nils Petter "storstark" /Johansson/
2 GIVN Nils Petter "storstark"
2 SURN Johansson
2 _MARNM Johansson
2 NICK Stark
2 NICK Nings
2 NICK Petter
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 21 MAY 1790
2 PLAC Risåträsk
