1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johan Gustaf Johnson´s mother Sara Lovisa Linder married Johan Fredrik Olofsson. The family first lived in Blattnicksele but later moved to Karolinelund. Sara Lovisa Linder came from Sandsjön and was Anders Gustaf 
2 CONC Linder's oldest daughter (baby no. 2 out of totally 19) and Johan Gustaf´s father came from Blattnicksele (originating from Skakträsk i.e. Aha). Sara Lovisa was known for being a good violin musician (at dances or other events). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Gustaf Johnson and his wife Eva Nilsson first lived at Matsberg in Malå from 1885. In 1917 he emigrated to the US and settled in Parshall, North Dakota.
