1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Carl Samuel Johnson´s mother Sara Lovisa Linder married Johan Fredrik Olofsson and moved to Karolinelund. She came from Sandsjön and was Anders Gustaf Linder's oldest daughter (baby no. 2 out of totally 19) and Car
2 CONC l Samuels father came from Blattnicksele (originating from Aha). Sara Lovisa was known for being a good violin musician (at dances or other events). 
