2 NOTE My grandmothers cousin Carl Samuel Johansson, who moved from Karolinerlund, Västerbotten with his wife and eight cildren to North Dakota in 1910 to 1912. In Sweden Carl Samuel and his wife were known for playing the violin and the
3 CONC  harmonica (dragspel) at dances. In 1917 his older brother and his family joined him in North Dakota.
